@startuml
hide empty description
title Stored archive state of a contact
state "Active\narchive = false" as Active
state "Archived\narchive = true" as Archived
[*] --> Active : create a new contact
Active --> Archived : archive INDEX or archive /tag TAG\nwithArchive(true), then setPerson
Archived --> Active : unarchive INDEX or unarchive /tag TAG\nwithArchive(false), then setPerson
note right of Active
  list and find show active contacts.
end note
note right of Archived
  list archived shows archived contacts.
end note
note bottom of Archived
  Both states remain in the same AddressBook.
  Listing changes only the view predicate.
  JSON persists the archive flag; loading restores it.
end note
@enduml
